<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4673] Object array element type is written as a user type</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4673</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;BinaryWriterExImpl.doWriteObjectArray&lt;/tt&gt; registers &lt;tt&gt;java.lang.Object&lt;/tt&gt; element type as a custom type instead of using &lt;tt&gt;OBJECT_TYPE_ID&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As a result, platforms (.NET, C++) can not understand such an array.&lt;br/&gt;
This is also suboptimal due to extra type registration and lookups.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13041407">IGNITE-4673</key>
